DESCRIPTION:Jordan Makin became notorious on Dry Bar Comedy for his beef wi
 th improv troupes and his love affair with fitness tracking devices. These 
 first two specials (The Big Fat Funny Ginger and Heckboy) received millions
  of views and “captured the hearts of a generation\,” (Jordan Makin\, 2
 022). In 2023\, Jordan released the album "Closed Concept" which is streami
 ng on Spotify and in rotation on SiriusXM. Jordan and his wife\, Adrienne\,
  host the weekly "My Wife Thinks" podcast. They live a happy life together 
 with their 5 cats.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/j
 ordan-makin-24359/
